        "original_id": "b8f84020-7d64-53f9-b41d-4f19db736742",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Drake, DJ Maphorisa, Kyla, Themba Sekowe\n- Songs: \"One Dance\", \"Do You Mind\", \"Ngud'\", \"Camino Del Sol\"\n- Albums: \"Views\"\n\nFacts:\n- Themba Sekowe, born in 1988, is a South African record producer and disk jockey known professionally as DJ Maphorisa.\n- Drake released the song \"One Dance\" on his 2016 fourth studio album \"Views\".\n- Kyla's song \"Do You Mind\" was later featured on Drake's 2016 international hit \"One Dance\".\n- The song \"Ngud'\" was produced by DJ Maphorisa.\n- \"Ngud'\" samples Joakim's remix of \"Camino Del Sol\" by Antena.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
